                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "A Smaller Bow",
                                  "Nib's practice\nnotes include a\ndramatic bow for\nthe end of every",
                                  "tour. The latest\nnote says: Ask if\nthey understood\nthe roof",
                                  "estimate. Bow if\nappropriate. His\nhat still has a\nfeather. Honesty",
                                  "has not required\nhim to become\ndull."
                                ],
                                "avatarId": "",
                                "minHeight": 4,
