                              "id": "18e8a450-5308-474c-a435-6422fe94d532",
                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Nib: The west\nsalon is called\nthe Winter Room\nbecause winter\nenters",
                                  "it. I used to call\nthat seasonal\nairflow. Now I am\ncalling a roofer.",
                                  "The junction door\nis behind the\nlisting stand, and\nthe easement is",
                                  "in the disclosure."
                                ],
